rticle>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>算命先生 · 天机完整原版</h2><p>完整复用 MIT 开源的“天机”Web 产品，保留原版八字、六爻、紫微斗数、中英双语、主题切换与分享功能；所有计算在浏览器本机完成。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：天机完整原版已合并至主分支，可作为局部试用入口；算命先生要求的其他成熟系统尚未完整接入，整体产品未验收。</p><a href=\"fortune-teller/index.html\">打开算命先生 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>零一空间研究 · 陪你读书</h2><p>整书阅读与聆听、目录、进度、笔记交流、背景音及经授权的个性化声音。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：已接入 Foliate 整书阅读器与封面书架，支持本地导入、目录、连续朗读和背景音；个性化声音训练与用户验收尚未完成。</p><a href=\"reader-integrated.html\">打开陪你读书 →</a> · <a href=\"reader-progress.html\">查看任务明细与进程 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>听世界 · 网络电台</h2><p>选择音乐和广播频道，边听边做自己的事。</p><a href=\"classical-radio.html\">打开听世界 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>看世界 · 直播频道</h2><p>世界直播、城市、自然、太空、音乐与文化视频。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：直name: Portal integrated delivery gate\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n    paths:\n      - 'portal/**'\n      - 'scripts/portal-delivery-smoke.cjs'\n      - 'scripts/fortune-teller-browser-verify.cjs'\n      - '.github/workflows/portal-delivery.yml'\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n    paths:\n      - 'portal/**'\n      - 'scripts/portal-delivery-smoke.cjs'\n      - 'scripts/fortune-teller-browser-verify.cjs'\n      - '.github/workflows/portal-delivery.yml'\npermissions:\n  contents: read\nconcurrency:\n  group: portal-delivery-${{ github.ref }}\n  cancel-in-progress: true\njobs:\n  browser-smoke:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 20\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: '22'\n      - name: Install pinned browser test dependency\n        run: |\n          npm install --no-save --no-package-lock playwright@1.55.0\n          npx playwright install chromium --with-deps\n      - name: Start complete portal locally\n        run: |\n          python3 -m http.server 4173 > /tmp/portal-http.log 2>&1 &\n          for attempt in {1..20}; do\n            curl -fsS http://127.